ReasonforDeviation_Summary:
Municipal reported the following challenges impacting on performance:
- supply chain management delays;
- poor performance of contractors;
- business forum interferences impacting on project progress;
- delay in the payment of invoices impacting on expenditure reporting;
- changing of project implementation priorities; and
- vacant positions

